{"type":"message","id":"5eb639da","parentId":"7e43f769","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:15:24.566Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 1:15 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 01:15 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778894124483}}
